From 93659c34d3062a0cf9b76954ca9891e590290626 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:24:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Speed up the portfolio and make it easier for recruiters
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Speed
- Logos resized to WebP at 2x display size (~1.3 MB -> ~75 KB)
- Remove live iframe previews on hover; smaller fallback screenshots
- Clock and rotating word are isolated components; card hover is CSS-only,
  so the page no longer re-renders every 2.4s or on mouse-over
- Preload hero fonts and photo
- Lenis: autoRaf, anchor offset, disabled for prefers-reduced-motion;
  drop conflicting scroll-behavior: smooth
- Remove unused Tailwind/PostCSS (replaced by a small base reset)
- Qspiders logo served locally instead of hotlinking LinkedIn's CDN

Recruiter experience
- Résumé / Email / LinkedIn buttons in the hero
- Résumé at a stable URL: /Harsh-Jha-Resume.pdf
- Case studies have shareable URLs (#work/<id>); Back and Escape close them
- Focus moves into the case study, Tab is trapped, focus is restored on close
- Contact form can post to a form endpoint (VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT), mailto fallback
- Open Graph / Twitter preview tags + 1200x630 preview image, JSON-LD
- Dark mode follows the OS and remembers the visitor's choice
- Personal Media section folded into footer links; clones demoted
- Real README

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWqfHCMBddsWmNrXfZC3XR
