+# Public build settings (nothing secret goes here; these end up in the built site).
+
+# Your live site, no trailing slash, e.g. https://harshjha.dev
+# Used for the link-preview image and canonical URL, which must be absolute for LinkedIn/Slack/WhatsApp.
+VITE_SITE_URL=
+
+# Optional: a form endpoint so "Send brief" delivers without opening a mail app.
+# Free option: create a form at https://formspree.io and paste its URL, e.g. https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz
+# Leave empty to keep the mailto: behaviour.
+VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
